181g|n|A machine, used for the purpose of giving cloth, paper, etc., a smooth, even, and glossy or glazed surface, by cold or hot pressure, or for watering them and giving them a wavy appearance. It consists of two or more cylinders revolving nearly in contact, with the necessary apparatus for moving and regulating. ; One who pursues the business of calendering. ; To press between rollers for the purpose of making smooth and glossy, or wavy, as woolen and silk stuffs, linens, paper, etc. ; One of a sect or order of fantastically dressed or painted dervishes.	a:43iv,114,9;9ehg,110,4;5yag,108,4;4wvx,103,15;3upd,100,47;17yk,94,5;71nr,91,30;25y5,88,2;4od8,79,19;4w0z,68,6;5fv1,65,10;4ydz,63,7;4ecu,61,5;260m,57,1;3sts,57,338~3sts,57,338;3ifa,38,98;d4e,36,72;22ah,27,48;3upd,100,47;676v,38,32;71nr,91,30;79ri,50,26;4v5d,17,20;4od8,79,19;8p3m,4,17;4wvx,103,15;6tfq,2,13;6ru0,52,13;84f,20,12	v:43iv,98,3;9ehg,90,1;9qgi,34,2;8l3e,28,17;3sts,20,27;9c0f,20,4;79ri,19,3;2dr7,19,4;8fmf,19,12;6ru0,15,1;2ib1,12,17;384r,10,3;7wn7,8,4;8n7p,5,5;a7g2,2,88~a7g2,2,88;3sts,20,27;8l3e,28,17;2ib1,12,17;8fmf,19,12;8n7p,5,5;7wn7,8,4;9c0f,20,4;2dr7,19,4;43iv,98,3;79ri,19,3;384r,10,3;9qgi,34,2;6ru0,15,1;9ehg,90,1	V:79oo,68,32;4m2k,59,10;79kx,34,10;6oac,28,6;2icp,15,5;ggp,15,12;8nd4,14,16;8fmf,6,5;a7g2,6,116~a7g2,6,116;79oo,68,32;8nd4,14,16;ggp,15,12;4m2k,59,10;79kx,34,10;6oac,28,6;2icp,15,5;8fmf,6,5	n:43iv,108,6;25y5,101,5;4wvx,96,9;9ehg,90,1;2655,77,45;269m,76,5;260m,73,3;6ru0,69,42;4ydz,65,8;43ow,64,7;627,61,3;9qgi,58,11;17zu,58,47;4v5z,53,2;84f,52,104~3sts,45,147;84f,52,104;4v5d,40,94;319b,29,66;294h,24,57;8l9c,49,50;17zu,58,47;2655,77,45;6ru0,69,42;25xb,17,26;9ysj,29,20;4rx5,11,14;4rss,6,12;5ya7,26,12;4mpv,27,11	N:34an,113,94;34ao,98,8;9lo1,64,4;ahog,57,7;ajmn,52,29;1u12,51,252;7w5f,50,6;79ri,50,26;17p6,49,7;74fs,47,7;49m7,47,40;fx2,45,141;6ss6,44,9;79kx,44,20;31h8,43,66~1u12,51,252;fx2,45,141;acby,33,130;gaa,31,110;319b,35,97;34an,113,94;1jlg,13,82;25xb,33,79;6j5v,19,78;31h8,43,66;9d1e,16,55;49